  "_approach": "Four-bar MC-drop build in classic 2-step language: the kick keeps its 2-step skeleton for two bars, straightens to 4/4 in bar 3 and disappears in bar 4 so the snare roll (backbeat -> 8ths -> 16ths) owns the last bar and peaks at 127 on the final 16th. Hats double from 8ths to 16ths as it climbs. Ref: the turnaround before the drop on Artful Dodger 'Re-Rewind', MJ Cole 'Sincere' (12\" mix). (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
